# Code owners for OpenPlaud.
#
# Owners are requested for review automatically on matching PRs. To make this
# binding, enable branch protection on `main` with "Require review from Code
# Owners". Security-sensitive paths are called out explicitly so changes to
# auth, crypto, CI, and secret-handling always get a second pair of eyes.

# Default owner for everything.
*                           @marcelomv-code

# Security-sensitive surfaces.
/.github/                   @marcelomv-code
/.githooks/                 @marcelomv-code
/.gitleaks.toml             @marcelomv-code
/.env.example               @marcelomv-code
/Dockerfile                 @marcelomv-code
/docker-entrypoint.sh       @marcelomv-code
/drizzle.config.ts          @marcelomv-code
